WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.236
<i>When my daughter was just a little girl...</i>

2
00:00:16.671 --> 00:00:19.366
<i>I promised to never leave her.</i>

3
00:00:20.734 --> 00:00:23.828
<i>That was one promise I could not keep.</i>

4
00:02:33.357 --> 00:02:35.201
You're late!

5
00:02:35.651 --> 00:02:39.788
- I had some shit I had to take care of.
- She's a ho, Steven.

6
00:02:40.072 --> 00:02:43.334
Sooner you get that through your head,
the better for you.

7
00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:48.630
Just give me the money.

8
00:02:50.708 --> 00:02:52.610
You're angry?

9
00:02:52.710 --> 00:02:55.221
Is it because of me or your ho?

10
00:02:56.839 --> 00:03:00.184
After all this time together,
you're not trusting me?

11
00:03:03.345 --> 00:03:05.898
This is our last transaction.

12
00:03:09.894 --> 00:03:12.088
Got a better source.

13
00:03:12.188 --> 00:03:15.382
Same grade, cheaper.

14
00:03:15.482 --> 00:03:16.993
JoJo?

15
00:03:17.944 --> 00:03:20.096
Oh, Jesus Christ.

16
00:03:20.196 --> 00:03:24.333
JoJo is small time, man.
His sources aren't even stable.

17
00:03:25.534 --> 00:03:27.478
I didn't think you were
this fucking stupid.

18
00:03:27.578 --> 00:03:29.563
He gave me the same exact grade as yours.

19
00:03:29.663 --> 00:03:32.424
Probably because he got it from me.

20
00:03:32.834 --> 00:03:35.486
He's selling it to you
for a low cost for now.

21
00:03:35.586 --> 00:03:38.030
The price is going to come up,
the quality's going to go down.

22
00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:40.282
He's just a fucking small-time
piece of shit.

23
00:03:40.382 --> 00:03:43.285
Got his hands in everything...
girls, money.

24
00:03:43.385 --> 00:03:46.831
Yeah, I know.
That's how I met your girlfriend.

25
00:03:46.931 --> 00:03:49.066
Angel, right?

26
00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:54.030
What a fine piece of ass.

27
00:03:56.357 --> 00:04:00.286
But don't worry, it was like a couple
years ago, before she met you.

28
00:04:01.112 --> 00:04:03.539
When she was still fresh.

29
00:04:10.287 --> 00:04:13.190
JoJo's giving me 10% off your cut.

30
00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:17.511
- Take five, and I'll stick with you.
- You take your 5% and go fuck yourself.

31
00:04:20.672 --> 00:04:21.991
I don't think you realize
who you're dealing with.

32
00:04:22.091 --> 00:04:26.437
I know exactly who I'm talking to,
motherfucker. Daddy's little boy.

33
00:04:34.478 --> 00:04:39.283
Hey, you're one fast motherfucker,
but I still got a sniper out there.

34
00:04:47.074 --> 00:04:49.393
10% is all it took
for you to fuck me over.

35
00:04:49.493 --> 00:04:51.854
Come on, man. It's business.

36
00:04:51.954 --> 00:04:54.340
Yeah, it is business.

37
00:04:54.832 --> 00:04:58.594
But what you said about Angel,
that's personal.

38
00:06:03.275 --> 00:06:05.660
Act surprised, okay?

39
00:06:08.072 --> 00:06:10.415
No, stupid.

40
00:06:13.327 --> 00:06:15.295
How do you do this?

41
00:06:21.919 --> 00:06:24.154
Here he comes, here he comes.

42
00:06:24.254 --> 00:06:26.223
Surprise!

43
00:06:27.758 --> 00:06:30.494
Thank you. Thank you.

44
00:06:30.594 --> 00:06:33.664
- Happy Birthday.
- Happy Birthday.

45
00:06:33.764 --> 00:06:36.483
- Thank you.
- I hate being married to a detective.

46
00:06:37.642 --> 00:06:40.755
- Your band sucks.
- That's 'cause our lead singer can't sing.

47
00:06:40.855 --> 00:06:42.464
Then why is he the lead singer?

48
00:06:42.564 --> 00:06:45.200
'Cause it's his studio,
and he owns all the equipment.

49
00:06:46.318 --> 00:06:48.012
Guess it makes sense.

50
00:06:48.112 --> 00:06:51.473
Let's say you skip your band practice
tonight and have dinner with the old man?

51
00:06:51.573 --> 00:06:54.584
- Okay.
- Great.

52
00:06:57.747 --> 00:07:00.465
You go ahead.
I'll take the kids to school.

53
00:07:02.417 --> 00:07:04.261
Thanks.

54
00:07:45.836 --> 00:07:48.388
Happy 50th, old man.

55
00:07:49.006 --> 00:07:53.285
Old woman found her.
Euro-Asian, late teens.

56
00:07:53.385 --> 00:07:56.496
M.E. is working on
time and cause of death.

57
00:07:56.596 --> 00:07:58.583
It's gonna be difficult.

58
00:07:58.683 --> 00:08:00.650
Anything else?

59
00:08:02.019 --> 00:08:05.965
Nothing yet. Divers are searching.
It's going to take another couple hours.

60
00:08:06.065 --> 00:08:08.617
Visibility down there is nil.

61
00:08:26.168 --> 00:08:28.195
Give me a smoke, man.

62
00:08:28.295 --> 00:08:31.932
- It's been, like, four years.
- Just give me a cigarette.

63
00:08:44.436 --> 00:08:47.923
Her name's Angel. No last name.

64
00:08:48.023 --> 00:08:50.718
Everyone has a last name.

65
00:08:50.818 --> 00:08:55.538
Not if your father's a ghost.
I'm gonna need a few personal days.

66
00:09:18.386 --> 00:09:21.539
<i>You have reached
the Balloon Catering Service.</i>

67
00:09:21.639 --> 00:09:24.109
<i>Please leave a message.</i>

68
00:09:24.601 --> 00:09:26.987
I'm in town. Meet me at the usual place.

69
00:09:50.711 --> 00:09:53.513
Sorry, I couldn't resist.

70
00:10:01.304 --> 00:10:04.232
I can't believe they've turned
this place into this.

71
00:10:06.977 --> 00:10:12.282
Yeah. Well, the war's been...
over for a long time, so...

72
00:10:12.733 --> 00:10:14.785
a playground is better than a cemetery.

73
00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:27.022
So why are you here?

74
00:10:27.122 --> 00:10:29.424
Something to tell me?

75
00:10:33.837 --> 00:10:36.139
Angel's dead.

76
00:10:37.174 --> 00:10:40.493
Her body was discovered early
yesterday morning off the river,

77
00:10:40.593 --> 00:10:43.146
Klong Bangkok Noi.

78
00:10:44.139 --> 00:10:46.399
She was found naked.

79
00:10:47.434 --> 00:10:49.820
Her wrists were bound.

80
00:10:51.063 --> 00:10:52.948
I'm sorry.

81
00:11:06.787 --> 00:11:08.797
I have a plan.

82
00:11:10.082 --> 00:11:14.402
I'll head back and work the case,
and you follow in.

83
00:11:14.502 --> 00:11:17.014
And stay off the radar.

84
00:11:20.133 --> 00:11:22.227
And then?

85
00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:25.105
By the time you land...

86
00:11:25.472 --> 00:11:28.483
I should have some leads
for us to start with.

87
00:11:30.894 --> 00:11:34.948
- Your partner?
- Yeah, he's a good cop.

88
00:11:35.315 --> 00:11:37.425
If there are any leads, he'll have 'em.

89
00:11:37.525 --> 00:11:39.577
And then?

90
00:11:40.112 --> 00:11:42.705
And then you do whatever you want.

91
00:11:43.656 --> 00:11:47.920
But until we find the people
responsible, you play by my rules.

92
00:11:57.755 --> 00:12:01.308
So... how is Ploy?

93
00:12:01.674 --> 00:12:05.854
She's doing well. She's a senior VP now.

94
00:12:09.391 --> 00:12:12.110
You know, you don't have
to do this, Peter.

95
00:12:12.352 --> 00:12:14.738
I can handle this myself, you know that.

96
00:12:15.188 --> 00:12:19.159
- I mean, you got a family. You got a...
- Hey, we do this together.

97
00:12:45.761 --> 00:12:48.830
And your friend? Is he coming?

98
00:12:48.930 --> 00:12:50.373
Yes.

99
00:12:50.473 --> 00:12:54.402
I think his daughter was mixed up
in a lot of gray stuff.

100
00:12:56.897 --> 00:13:02.594
Her father and I were recruited
by the CIA... as locals.

101
00:13:02.694 --> 00:13:05.221
- We met during training.
- Air America?

102
00:13:05.321 --> 00:13:07.766
How fucking old do you think I am?

103
00:13:07.866 --> 00:13:10.727
We became Americans
and joined the military.

104
00:13:10.827 --> 00:13:14.731
We came back 12 years later.
I became a cop, and he went private.

105
00:13:14.831 --> 00:13:18.093
- Blackwater?
- There's no such thing anymore.

106
00:13:19.669 --> 00:13:23.473
- What else do you have?
- She has a titanium rod in her forearm.

107
00:13:23.924 --> 00:13:28.644
Doc says it's about a couple years old.
Only a few hospitals could do it.

108
00:13:30.388 --> 00:13:32.941
So where's your friend?

109
00:14:29.698 --> 00:14:31.374
I love you.

110
00:15:03.356 --> 00:15:06.034
Forgot how humid it gets here.

111
00:15:07.610 --> 00:15:11.514
Meet my partner, Karn.
He's tracked down some potential perps.

112
00:15:11.614 --> 00:15:13.708
We've got three.

113
00:15:28.840 --> 00:15:30.867
This guy...

114
00:15:30.967 --> 00:15:33.078
Her boyfriend or her friend's boyfriend?

115
00:15:33.178 --> 00:15:35.622
Her friend's. Crystal and Patrick.

116
00:15:35.722 --> 00:15:39.793
She's half Thai, he's Turkish. They've been
living here for the past six years.

117
00:15:39.893 --> 00:15:42.278
She didn't have a boyfriend?

118
00:15:43.646 --> 00:15:46.157
Not one that I found, no.

119
00:15:53.656 --> 00:15:56.267
Karn believes that the two
will be in Khao San tonight.

120
00:15:56.367 --> 00:15:59.253
There are a couple of bars
they like to frequent.

121
00:16:00.163 --> 00:16:03.107
- Johnny.
- I know.

122
00:16:03.207 --> 00:16:05.676
- No, you don't.
- I do know.

123
00:16:06.585 --> 00:16:09.931
I'm very aware of where
I am about to step into.

124
00:16:10.173 --> 00:16:12.241
But believe me...

125
00:16:12.341 --> 00:16:16.580
as a cop who's been investigating
sex crimes for 20 years...

126
00:16:16.680 --> 00:16:21.109
and a father of three young children,
and as your friend...

127
00:16:21.392 --> 00:16:23.252
Johnny...

128
00:16:23.352 --> 00:16:27.674
I know we've seen some dark, weird shit,
but this is your own daughter.

129
00:16:27.774 --> 00:16:29.408
I understand.

130
00:16:30.694 --> 00:16:32.495
Okay.

131
00:16:33.822 --> 00:16:37.141
Karn, you track Crystal and Patrick.

132
00:16:37.241 --> 00:16:39.753
I know where to track Steven now.

133
00:17:02.058 --> 00:17:04.110
That's him.

134
00:17:15.446 --> 00:17:19.583
We go in here, we go in hard.
These guys don't fuck around.

135
00:17:28.209 --> 00:17:29.235
Can I help you?

136
00:17:29.335 --> 00:17:32.697
I'm looking for a Crystal Logan,
Room C 23.

137
00:17:32.797 --> 00:17:35.308
Do you have a warrant?

138
00:17:50.606 --> 00:17:52.951
I'll call for backup.

139
00:18:24.808 --> 00:18:27.360
- Everything good?
- Yes, boss. It's all quiet.

140
00:18:29.145 --> 00:18:32.073
Man, where have you been?

141
00:18:33.983 --> 00:18:38.496
Jesus, you just don't fucking get it.
Do you know what we have sitting here?

142
00:18:38.905 --> 00:18:41.374
Hey! Drop it.

143
00:18:48.873 --> 00:18:50.775
How we looking?

144
00:18:50.875 --> 00:18:54.846
Everything's ready. We're just waiting
for you to make the calls.

145
00:19:14.482 --> 00:19:18.285
Listen, wrong way, mate.
Turn around and jog on.

146
00:19:21.781 --> 00:19:23.833
I'll blow your fucking head off!

147
00:19:27.787 --> 00:19:31.924
<i>Finally. I'll see you at the usual place.</i>

148
00:20:32.935 --> 00:20:34.653
Police!

149
00:21:16.270 --> 00:21:17.905
I don't want you to go.

150
00:21:19.231 --> 00:21:21.575
You know I have to.

151
00:21:22.526 --> 00:21:25.913
- Stay with me.
- I really... I really do have to go.

152
00:21:27.614 --> 00:21:29.666
I love you.

153
00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:33.755
That's sweet.

154
00:21:35.748 --> 00:21:38.025
"Sweet"? Yeah?

155
00:21:38.125 --> 00:21:40.762
I'm not fucking sweet!

156
00:22:02.316 --> 00:22:04.076
All right. Let's split up.

157
00:22:04.401 --> 00:22:07.496
Karn, you check out the other places.

158
00:22:11.367 --> 00:22:13.686
Welcome to Khao San.

159
00:22:13.786 --> 00:22:18.007
We're going to meet someone who usually
knows everything that goes on around here.

160
00:22:49.529 --> 00:22:51.498
That's her.

161
00:22:59.331 --> 00:23:01.942
Excuse me. May I sit down
and ask you some questions?

162
00:23:02.042 --> 00:23:04.845
I'm always happy to help
the local police. Please sit.

163
00:23:12.469 --> 00:23:14.664
Your friend isn't a cop.

164
00:23:14.764 --> 00:23:18.333
- No, he's not.
- Who is he?

165
00:23:18.433 --> 00:23:20.778
He's my friend.

166
00:23:21.103 --> 00:23:24.965
Am I being charged for anything
or is this just a friendly chat?

167
00:23:25.065 --> 00:23:27.201
It's a friendly chat.

168
00:23:36.160 --> 00:23:39.438
Crystal, Angel, and Patrick.
Good kids. All three of them.

169
00:23:39.538 --> 00:23:43.483
Why is a high-ranking police officer
looking for them?

170
00:23:43.583 --> 00:23:46.320
How do you know them?

171
00:23:46.420 --> 00:23:48.222
Answer my question please.

172
00:23:50.465 --> 00:23:57.022
This is Angel's father.
Her body was found three days ago.

173
00:23:58.598 --> 00:24:00.735
I'm so sorry.

174
00:24:04.563 --> 00:24:06.340
You knew her well?

175
00:24:06.440 --> 00:24:08.508
Angel was a lovely girl.
I liked her a lot.

176
00:24:08.608 --> 00:24:11.871
- I liked her a lot.
- Thank you.

177
00:24:12.321 --> 00:24:14.640
Can you help us?

178
00:24:14.740 --> 00:24:17.017
- Angel came to me three years ago.
- Three years ago...

179
00:24:17.117 --> 00:24:19.812
- She came to see me.
- ...she came to see me.

180
00:24:19.912 --> 00:24:24.524
- She was looking for customers.
- She was looking for customers.

181
00:24:24.624 --> 00:24:26.777
- At first I sent her away...
- I chased her away...

182
00:24:26.877 --> 00:24:29.554
- ...but she was persistent.
- ...but she was very stubborn.

183
00:24:30.047 --> 00:24:31.824
She didn't want any middle man.

184
00:24:31.924 --> 00:24:34.534
She didn't need any middle man
with nothing to lose.

185
00:24:34.634 --> 00:24:37.104
You mean pimps?

186
00:24:37.847 --> 00:24:40.040
She wanted a quick way in.

187
00:24:40.140 --> 00:24:42.401
She wanted a quick way in.

188
00:24:45.312 --> 00:24:46.922
Did you hook her up?

189
00:24:47.022 --> 00:24:49.549
No. But that didn't stop her.

190
00:24:49.649 --> 00:24:53.662
- No, but it didn't stop her.
- And you said you liked her.

191
00:24:55.239 --> 00:24:57.958
- But you didn't help her?
- To be used by other men?

192
00:24:58.283 --> 00:25:00.560
- So she could be used by men?
- No.

193
00:25:00.660 --> 00:25:02.504
No.

194
00:25:03.038 --> 00:25:06.191
- Did you know your daughter?
- Do you know your daughter well?

195
00:25:06.291 --> 00:25:08.277
- What Angel wants.
- Anything Angel wants...

196
00:25:08.377 --> 00:25:11.721
- She has to get.
- ...she has to get.

197
00:25:13.673 --> 00:25:14.950
Did you give her your contacts?

198
00:25:15.050 --> 00:25:19.872
I left that world a long time ago.
My contacts would be useless to her.

199
00:25:19.972 --> 00:25:23.375
- But you knew people?
- I did.

200
00:25:23.475 --> 00:25:26.128
Angel did it herself.

201
00:25:26.228 --> 00:25:29.048
I've never seen anyone move up
in the trade so fast.

202
00:25:29.148 --> 00:25:30.716
I've never seen anyone come in this fast.

203
00:25:30.816 --> 00:25:34.303
- Beautiful.
- She's a beautiful girl.

204
00:25:34.403 --> 00:25:35.971
Very smart.

205
00:25:36.071 --> 00:25:38.140
And very smart. A lot of men came for her.

206
00:25:38.240 --> 00:25:42.687
- She had protection from the bigwigs.
- But she had protection from bigwigs.

207
00:25:42.787 --> 00:25:47.566
- But there was one that stood out.
- But there was one that stood out.

208
00:25:47.666 --> 00:25:49.652
And what was his name?

209
00:25:49.752 --> 00:25:53.614
JoJo. He operates around this area.

210
00:25:53.714 --> 00:25:57.868
They like to target young backpackers.

211
00:25:57.968 --> 00:26:01.731
Lady backpackers
or foreigners who need money.

212
00:26:10.981 --> 00:26:14.093
Nothing there.
A couple of regulars recognized them,

213
00:26:14.193 --> 00:26:16.912
but didn't really know who they were.

214
00:26:18.030 --> 00:26:20.348
Hey, excuse me. You guy...

215
00:26:20.448 --> 00:26:22.643
You two look a bit lost.
How can I help you?

216
00:26:22.743 --> 00:26:25.020
- We're okay, thank you.
- Oh, come on.

217
00:26:25.120 --> 00:26:28.757
You look like you can use
some coffee and a sandwich.

218
00:26:29.582 --> 00:26:31.944
Hey, my friend have
a restaurant over there.

219
00:26:32.044 --> 00:26:34.988
If you change your mind,
you can come to join me.

220
00:26:35.088 --> 00:26:37.140
The purple sign.

221
00:26:38.591 --> 00:26:41.787
- What do you think?
- Why not? It's a public place.

222
00:26:41.887 --> 00:26:45.816
Hey! How long before your flight leaves?

223
00:26:46.684 --> 00:26:51.171
Your flight out of Bangkok?
How many days do you have to wait?

224
00:26:51.271 --> 00:26:53.365
Three days.

225
00:26:56.443 --> 00:27:00.430
Take it. Go get yourself a decent room.

226
00:27:00.530 --> 00:27:04.877
And order in, stay in until you have
to leave for the airport. Understood?

227
00:27:07.120 --> 00:27:09.172
Take it.

228
00:27:10.248 --> 00:27:12.675
Take it and go.

229
00:27:41.446 --> 00:27:43.791
What can I do you for gentlemen?

230
00:27:45.533 --> 00:27:47.669
You know her?

231
00:27:52.499 --> 00:27:56.636
Yeah, she comes around here
all the time. That's... Angel.

232
00:27:56.962 --> 00:27:59.347
She's usually with... Patrick and Crystal.

233
00:27:59.506 --> 00:28:01.391
And when was the last time you saw them?

234
00:28:03.051 --> 00:28:06.664
- About a week ago.
- And the other two?

235
00:28:06.764 --> 00:28:08.791
Two or three days ago.

236
00:28:08.891 --> 00:28:12.377
- Angel wasn't with them?
- No.

237
00:28:12.477 --> 00:28:14.822
You have a very good memory.

238
00:28:15.397 --> 00:28:18.241
Yeah. She's a good kid.

239
00:28:18.776 --> 00:28:20.302
I like her.

240
00:28:20.402 --> 00:28:24.765
A bit lost sometimes, but she always pays
her bills and never gives me any trouble.

241
00:28:24.865 --> 00:28:27.601
When you own a bar, that's all
you can ask from your customers.

242
00:28:27.701 --> 00:28:31.880
- Where can I find them?
- I don't know. You can try here later.

243
00:28:32.748 --> 00:28:34.925
How much later?

244
00:28:35.709 --> 00:28:37.552
Later.

245
00:28:38.670 --> 00:28:40.614
You gonna close me down?

246
00:28:40.714 --> 00:28:43.408
I just want to find Crystal
and the boyfriend,

247
00:28:43.508 --> 00:28:47.562
- ask them a few questions.
- What about Angel?

248
00:28:47.930 --> 00:28:50.148
She's dead.

