505
01:01:43.151 --> 01:01:46.038
No, but you can.

506
01:04:44.457 --> 01:04:49.512
- Now what?
- One last place. My Egg.

507
01:06:49.040 --> 01:06:50.984
Gentlemen.

508
01:06:51.084 --> 01:06:53.553
Follow me please.

509
01:07:19.112 --> 01:07:21.973
Membership is two million bahts a year.

510
01:07:22.073 --> 01:07:23.892
Drinks are complimentary.

511
01:07:23.992 --> 01:07:27.896
And everything else, you pay as you go.

512
01:07:27.996 --> 01:07:32.717
Tell me. What does this
get us for the night?

513
01:07:35.921 --> 01:07:38.598
Pretty much whatever you want.

514
01:07:38.882 --> 01:07:40.617
Young.

515
01:07:40.717 --> 01:07:43.186
I like them young.

516
01:07:44.054 --> 01:07:46.873
We specialize in that, too.

517
01:07:46.973 --> 01:07:49.818
- How young?
- How young do you go?

518
01:07:54.189 --> 01:07:57.784
You know there is more
where that came from.

519
01:08:00.111 --> 01:08:02.622
Of course there is.

520
01:08:03.990 --> 01:08:07.310
It will be half a million
for the both of you.

521
01:08:07.410 --> 01:08:09.420
They better be real ones.

522
01:08:09.871 --> 01:08:14.234
Now if these girls aren't what you claim
them to be, there'll be hell to pay.

523
01:08:14.334 --> 01:08:16.677
Do you understand?

524
01:08:19.422 --> 01:08:22.116
I can assure you that here,

525
01:08:22.216 --> 01:08:25.353
we do not resort to any tricks.

526
01:08:25.636 --> 01:08:28.356
You will get what you pay for.

527
01:09:22.443 --> 01:09:25.454
These are the youngest four
we have on site.

528
01:09:32.536 --> 01:09:34.172
Roofies?

529
01:09:36.415 --> 01:09:37.967
Ambien.

530
01:09:38.793 --> 01:09:41.279
Keeps them conscious and active.

531
01:09:41.379 --> 01:09:45.324
We give them two doses.
Completely harmless.

532
01:09:45.424 --> 01:09:48.644
They even wake up without a hangover.

533
01:09:53.307 --> 01:09:54.793
Why don't you go talk to your boss,

534
01:09:54.893 --> 01:09:58.212
see what kind of deal
he can cut us for the four.

535
01:09:58.312 --> 01:10:02.008
But we want them all night.
Come morning, if we're satisfied,

536
01:10:02.108 --> 01:10:03.868
we'll pay cash for the membership.

537
01:10:05.444 --> 01:10:07.246
Okay.

538
01:12:30.840 --> 01:12:33.100
Tell me about Angel.

539
01:12:39.181 --> 01:12:41.818
Who the fuck are you?

540
01:12:42.727 --> 01:12:45.071
I'm her father.

541
01:12:47.899 --> 01:12:50.701
Yeah, I can see why she left home.

542
01:12:51.235 --> 01:12:53.512
Don't tell me.

543
01:12:53.612 --> 01:12:57.708
You're another one who loved her, too?

544
01:12:58.534 --> 01:13:00.627
She's dead.

545
01:13:04.707 --> 01:13:07.151
- How?
- Murdered.

546
01:13:07.251 --> 01:13:09.654
And you think I did it?

547
01:13:09.754 --> 01:13:13.682
- She was seeing someone else.
- I was the someone else!

548
01:13:16.010 --> 01:13:17.369
You okay with all that?

549
01:13:17.469 --> 01:13:21.523
You fucked up as a father and now your
daughter's dead. Are you okay with that?

550
01:13:23.434 --> 01:13:27.463
You're going to tell me
everything you know about Angel.

551
01:13:27.563 --> 01:13:29.991
Why don't you put your gun down...

552
01:13:31.067 --> 01:13:34.120
and see if you can beat it out of me.

553
01:14:39.635 --> 01:14:41.938
You are...

554
01:14:42.221 --> 01:14:45.775
gonna tell me everything
you know about Angel.

555
01:14:49.687 --> 01:14:51.781
Fuck you.

556
01:15:05.244 --> 01:15:07.713
This is gonna hurt.

557
01:15:22.302 --> 01:15:25.998
- Okay, okay. Please.
- Tell me about Angel.

558
01:15:26.098 --> 01:15:29.627
She used to work here,
but she left over years ago.

559
01:15:29.727 --> 01:15:32.421
- We don't have anything to do with her.
- Did you recruited her?

560
01:15:32.521 --> 01:15:37.259
No. She came to me on her own,
and then she left.

561
01:15:37.359 --> 01:15:41.246
- So you just let her go?
- She knows people.

562
01:15:41.989 --> 01:15:43.665
She knew people.

563
01:15:47.577 --> 01:15:49.546
I liked her.

564
01:15:52.332 --> 01:15:58.138
You think this fancy dress can hide
a country girl from Vietnam?

565
01:15:59.882 --> 01:16:02.476
Who would want to kill her?

566
01:16:03.969 --> 01:16:05.871
Who?

567
01:16:05.971 --> 01:16:08.107
I don't know.

568
01:16:10.100 --> 01:16:12.194
Many people liked her.

569
01:16:14.313 --> 01:16:21.286
She's the kind of woman
that all men kill for.

570
01:16:24.573 --> 01:16:29.169
You men are simple creatures.

571
01:16:29.995 --> 01:16:32.272
She understood that.

572
01:16:32.372 --> 01:16:34.424
She used it.

573
01:16:36.752 --> 01:16:39.697
She knows how to use men...

574
01:16:39.797 --> 01:16:43.308
better than anyone I've seen.

575
01:16:44.134 --> 01:16:45.811
She met someone.

576
01:16:46.428 --> 01:16:48.438
Who?

577
01:16:51.266 --> 01:16:54.820
I don't know. But it changed her.

578
01:16:56.271 --> 01:16:58.507
How did he change her?

579
01:16:58.607 --> 01:17:00.635
She left this place.

580
01:17:00.735 --> 01:17:05.622
Almost all her clients complained
because she dumped them.

581
01:17:06.073 --> 01:17:10.686
They spent more time and money here

582
01:17:10.786 --> 01:17:13.522
in the hopes they'd find a replacement.

583
01:17:13.622 --> 01:17:16.008
They never could.

584
01:17:17.292 --> 01:17:20.179
No one was like Angel.

585
01:17:29.346 --> 01:17:34.359
What are you going to do now?

586
01:17:43.402 --> 01:17:46.330
You're not going to wake up
with a hangover either.

587
01:18:03.964 --> 01:18:06.475
I need you to fix up my friend.

588
01:18:40.292 --> 01:18:42.027
Peter.

589
01:18:42.127 --> 01:18:44.905
You come see me after so long time?

590
01:18:45.005 --> 01:18:46.865
- Hello, Mekael.
- Mickey.

591
01:18:46.965 --> 01:18:51.603
How many time I tell you call me Mickey?
Like the little mouse, da?

592
01:18:52.805 --> 01:18:55.148
You bring friend.

593
01:18:55.640 --> 01:18:58.944
Look like he make someone's husband angry?

594
01:18:59.644 --> 01:19:01.947
Oh, it's not knife.

595
01:19:02.605 --> 01:19:04.616
Ice pick?

596
01:19:08.821 --> 01:19:12.557
Oh, you black ops all the same, eh?
So tough.

597
01:19:12.657 --> 01:19:14.517
Fucking Rambo, eh?

598
01:19:14.617 --> 01:19:17.880
Drink. Helps.

599
01:19:41.019 --> 01:19:44.047
This one real-deal black op.

600
01:19:44.147 --> 01:19:46.574
I don't think we'll see Rambo.

601
01:19:56.076 --> 01:20:00.505
My own concoction.
He sleep for an hour, he feel nothing.

602
01:20:01.164 --> 01:20:04.968
But when he wake up, you give him this.

603
01:20:05.627 --> 01:20:08.972
Painkiller. Take all four.

604
01:20:09.798 --> 01:20:12.726
Have to disinfect all the way through.

605
01:20:27.357 --> 01:20:29.952
I'm surprised you have not heard
from our friend yet.

606
01:20:30.986 --> 01:20:32.512
Why?

607
01:20:32.612 --> 01:20:36.333
Because she owns the club
you destroyed last night.

608
01:20:57.220 --> 01:20:59.356
Feels better.

609
01:20:59.639 --> 01:21:03.110
It should. He knows what he's doing.

610
01:21:04.019 --> 01:21:05.946
Russian?

611
01:21:06.689 --> 01:21:09.950
Thought you left that world
when you came back here.

612
01:21:10.567 --> 01:21:13.220
- We better get going.
- Where to?

613
01:21:13.320 --> 01:21:15.831
You remember where I get my information?

614
01:21:36.634 --> 01:21:39.021
You lied to us.

615
01:21:44.392 --> 01:21:47.570
So the noodle bar is just a front?

616
01:21:48.605 --> 01:21:51.592
You better tell us what we want to hear
or I'll shut down everything,

617
01:21:51.692 --> 01:21:54.094
including the noodle bar.

618
01:21:54.194 --> 01:21:56.388
What's your connection to Steven?

619
01:21:56.488 --> 01:21:58.849
He was my business partner.

620
01:21:58.949 --> 01:22:01.309
He left you for my daughter?

621
01:22:01.409 --> 01:22:03.796
If that were the case...

622
01:22:04.287 --> 01:22:06.631
she would have been dead a long time ago,

623
01:22:06.874 --> 01:22:10.218
and you would have never found her body.

624
01:22:10.377 --> 01:22:13.571
But I did not kill her.

625
01:22:13.671 --> 01:22:15.891
She was like a sister to me.

626
01:22:16.758 --> 01:22:19.160
- What do you want?
- I need you to leave Bangkok.

627
01:22:19.260 --> 01:22:21.580
You have made things
really difficult for me.

628
01:22:21.680 --> 01:22:24.190
What do you want in exchange?

629
01:22:27.853 --> 01:22:30.446
Do you want to know how Angel died?

630
01:22:34.442 --> 01:22:36.678
You know how Angel died?

631
01:22:36.778 --> 01:22:39.164
No, she doesn't.

632
01:22:39.740 --> 01:22:41.642
I have it on tape.

633
01:22:41.742 --> 01:22:45.378
Sammy uploaded a clip
from Patrick's phone onto his laptop.

634
01:22:45.829 --> 01:22:47.672
Do you know where it is?

635
01:22:49.916 --> 01:22:51.301
In the car.

636
01:23:13.273 --> 01:23:15.116
Johnny.

637
01:23:22.741 --> 01:23:25.168
This isn't your fault.

638
01:25:52.515 --> 01:25:55.526
<i>Fuck! Don't... don't stop breathing.</i>

639
01:26:00.148 --> 01:26:02.759
<i>She isn't... she isn't breathing.</i>

640
01:26:02.859 --> 01:26:05.203
<i>She isn't breathing. She...</i>

641
01:26:06.905 --> 01:26:08.973
<i>No!</i>

642
01:26:09.073 --> 01:26:11.417
<i>She's not...</i>
